      span: full NxN (touches all 4 edges of the crop bbox)
      pattern: dotted/irregular perimeter-heavy mask, density 0.17-0.32 [observed]; most cells lie on or near the border rows/cols
    layer_1 (middle):
      span: roughly (N-2..N-4) square, centered on crop center
      pattern: ring-like or decorated sprite, density 0.3-0.5 [observed]
    layer_2 (innermost):
      span: 1..5, centered on crop center
      pattern: small central sprite, may occupy center pixel(s)
    layout: all 3 layer bboxes share the same center (crop center); outer layer strictly encloses inner ones
    asymmetry: each rotating layer (see cue list) must be rotationally asymmetric at 90/180/270 so rotation is visible; rotationally-symmetric layers are allowed only for colors without a cue
  src (cue sprites, outside board):
    count: 1..3 monochromatic sprites, one per rotating color (subset of board colors; any color may lack a cue -> no rotation)
    color: each cue color matches exactly one board color
    size: 1-5 cells [observed]; size_mod_4 encodes rot_k (rotation = (-size) % 4 quarter turns CW applied to that color's mask)
    shape: small blob/line/rect, monochrome, 8-connected
